   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Rules, checked in this order:\n1. visits >= 40         -> end (step budget used)\n2. no verdict           -> end\n3. pass                 -> end (success)\n4. stop                 -> end\n5. fix, repairs < 3     -> coder\n6. fix, repairs = 3     -> end (repairs used up)\n7. replan, replans < 2  -> planner\n8. replan, replans = 2  -> end (replans used up)",
   "originalText": "Rules, checked in this order:\n1. visits >= 40         -> end (step budget used)\n2. no verdict           -> end\n3. pass                 -> end (success)\n4. stop                 -> end\n5. fix, repairs < 3     -> coder\n6. fix, repairs = 3     -> end (repairs used up)\n7. replan, replans < 2  -> planner\n8. replan, replans = 2  -> end (replans used up)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "b_rules",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
