   "text": "Counter rules\nrepairs / replans = how many\nwere already done. The router\nreads them BEFORE any bump.\nThe node doing the repair\n(coder or planner) adds 1 and\nclears the verdict. The\nreviewer never bumps.",
   "originalText": "Counter rules\nrepairs / replans = how many\nwere already done. The router\nreads them BEFORE any bump.\nThe node doing the repair\n(coder or planner) adds 1 and\nclears the verdict. The\nreviewer never bumps.",
