   "text": "Then: ExecResult goes into last_exec and code_versions. The reviewer sees the command that ran, the exit code, the scan flags",
   "originalText": "Then: ExecResult goes into last_exec and code_versions. The reviewer sees the command that ran, the exit code, the scan flags",
